<body>
<section class="cover">
  <div class="brand">LUDO$OM · FAA’IIDO QAR$OON</div>
  <h1>Buugga Nidaamka Lacagta iyo Dakhliga</h1>
  <h2>Sharaxaad ganacsi, xisaabeed iyo farsamo oo ku saabsan Player, Agent, Admin, Games, VIP, Tournaments, Betting, Refunds iyo Penalties.</h2>
  <div class="meta"><b>Nooca 1.0</b><br>La diyaariyey: 24 Agoosto 2026<br>Ku salaysan code-ka production-ka ee hadda jira</div>
</section>

<h1>Hordhac iyo Ujeeddo</h1>
<p>Dukumentigan wuxuu sharxayaa dhammaan meelaha lacagtu ka soo gasho, meelaha ay ku baxdo, cidda leh, sida loo xisaabiyo, sida loo diiwaangeliyo, iyo xaaladaha lacag celinta ama ganaaxa ee LudoSom. Tirooyinka ku qoran waa kuwa code-ka hadda ku jira; admin-ku wuxuu beddeli karaa qaar ka mid ah qorshayaasha sida VIP, tournaments, agents iyo payment providers.</p>
<div class="callout"><b>Qaanuunka ugu muhiimsan:</b> lacagta stake-ka ah marka ciyaartu bilaabato waxaa laga saaraa wallet-ka ciyaaryahan kasta oo lagu xiraa <i>escrow</i>. Marka server-ku xaqiijiyo natiijada, escrow-ga waxaa loo kala diraa winner payout iyo app revenue.</div>
<div class="callout warning"><b>Gross iyo Net:</b> qoraal sida “Bet $0.30 · Win $0.60” wuxuu muujinayaa pot-ka kahor app rake. Lacagta winner-ka dhab ahaan loo credit-gareeyo user caadi ah waa $0.54.</div>

<h2>Tusmada Buugga</h2>
<table class="toc">
<tr><td>1. Khariidadda lacagta iyo erayada muhiimka ah</td><td>Player → Escrow/Agent/Admin → Settlement</td></tr>
<tr><td>2. Wallet, signup bonus, deposit iyo withdrawal</td><td>Gelinta iyo bixinta lacagta</td></tr>
<tr><td>3. Ciyaaraha dadka iyo rake</td><td>Solo, 3/4-player iyo 2v2</td></tr>
<tr><td>4. VIP</td><td>Qiime, muddo iyo rake discount</td></tr>
<tr><td>5. Bot economy</td><td>+$0.01 / −$0.02</td></tr>
<tr><td>6. Forfeit, inactivity, exit iyo refund</td><td>Ka bixista iyo ciyaar-joojinta</td></tr>
<tr><td>7. Spectator betting</td><td>Dynamic pool, odds iyo 10%</td></tr>
<tr><td>8. Tournaments</td><td>Entry, prize, margin, check-in iyo cancellation</td></tr>
<tr><td>9. Agent</td><td>Float, commission, player deposit/withdrawal</td></tr>
<tr><td>10. Admin iyo cashier</td><td>Revenue dashboard, approvals iyo payroll</td></tr>
<tr><td>11. Transaction ledger iyo kaydinta xogta</td><td>Audit trail</td></tr>
<tr><td>12. Shaxda dakhliga app-ka</td><td>9 revenue categories</td></tr>
<tr><td>13. Meelaha aan dakhli toos ah lahayn</td><td>Ads, practice, voice iyo daawasho</td></tr>
<tr><td>14. Risk iyo talooyin sixid</td><td>Qodobbada la ogaaday</td></tr>
</table>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>1. Khariidadda Lacagta</h1>
<h2>1.1 Erayada muhiimka ah</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Eray</th><th>Macnaha</th><th>Yaa leh?</th></tr>
<tr><td>Wallet balance</td><td>Lacagta hadda ku jirta akoonka user-ka.</td><td>Player</td></tr>
<tr><td>Stake / Bet Amount</td><td>Lacagta qof kasta ku galayo ciyaarta.</td><td>Player ilaa la lock-gareeyo</td></tr>
<tr><td>Escrow</td><td>Wadarta stakes-ka laga jaray ciyaartoyda, sugaysa natiijada server-ka.</td><td>Ku-meelgaar; cidna weli ma qaadan</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gross pot</td><td>Stake × tirada ciyaartoyda lacagta bixisay.</td><td>Escrow</td></tr>
<tr><td>Rake</td><td>Boqolkiiba app-ku ka qaato gross pot-ka.</td><td>App/Admin</td></tr>
<tr><td>Net payout</td><td>Gross pot − rake; lacagta winners-ka loo credit-gareeyo.</td><td>Winner(s)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Net profit</td><td>Net payout − stake-gii winner-ka laga jaray.</td><td>Winner</td></tr>
<tr><td>Float</td><td>Lacag shaqo oo agent-ku ku maamulo player deposits/withdrawals.</td><td>Agent ledger</td></tr>
<tr><td>House revenue</td><td>Rake, fees, VIP iyo margins si rasmi ah loogu qoray app commission.</td><td>App/Admin</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>1.2 Socodka guud</h2>
<div class="formula">Deposit → Player Wallet → Stake Locked in Escrow → Server Result → Winner Payout + App Revenue</div>
<p>Deposit iyo withdrawal lacag faa’iido ma aha iyaga qudhoodu; waa dhaqdhaqaaq wallet. App-ku dakhli wuxuu helaa marka rake, fee, VIP price, tournament margin ama betting margin la diiwaangeliyo.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>2. Wallet, Bonus, Deposit iyo Withdrawal</h1>
<h2>2.1 Signup bonus</h2>
<ul>
<li>User cusub wuxuu helaa <b>$1.00 welcome bonus</b>.</li>
<li>Bonus-ku wallet-ka wuu ka muuqdaa oo ciyaar ayaa lagu geli karaa.</li>
<li>Bonus-ku withdrawal ahaan ma furmo ilaa user-ku sameeyo ugu yaraan <b>$5.00 approved deposits</b>.</li>
<li>Admin stats-ku welcome bonuses-ka wuxuu u tiriyaa kharash, wuxuuna ka jaraa net platform earnings.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2.2 Deposit</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Waddo</th><th>Waxa dhacaya marka la ansixiyo</th><th>Dakhli app?</th></tr>
<tr><td>Admin/Cashier manual</td><td>Player balance + amount; request approved; transaction “deposit”.</td><td>Maya</td></tr>
<tr><td>Agent manual</td><td>Player balance + amount; agent float − amount.</td><td>Maya; waa float movement</td></tr>
<tr><td>Payment API</td><td>Haddii provider enabled/API key leeyahay, wallet + amount.</td><td>Code-ku deposit fee ma qaado</td></tr>
<tr><td>Simulated endpoint</td><td>Wallet + amount oo transaction la qoro.</td><td>Maya; production control ahaan waa in la adkeeyo</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Promo-code ku xiran user wuxuu ku xiran yahay agent-kiisa; agent kale looma diri karo. User aan agent lahayn wuxuu maraa admin/cashier magaalada la doortay.</p>

<h2>2.3 Withdrawal</h2>
<ul>
<li>Minimum withdrawal: <b>$2.00</b>.</li>
<li>User balance-ku waa inuu daboolaa amount-ka.</li>
<li>Withdrawable balance-ku wuxuu ku salaysan yahay approved real deposits + win payouts + bonus la furay − completed/pending withdrawals.</li>
<li>Refunds-ka iyo welcome bonus-ka aan furmin si toos ah uguma biiraan withdrawable formula.</li>
<li>Haddii user-ku ciyaaray paid game: normal withdrawal fee = <b>0%</b>.</li>
<li>Haddii uusan paid game dhammayn: fee = <b>10%</b>, ugu yaraan <b>$0.10</b>.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Tusaale: withdrawal kahor paid game</h3>
<div class="formula">Request $10.00 → Fee $1.00 → User wallet −$10.00 → Net cash paid $9.00 → App revenue $1.00</div>
<h3>Tusaale: withdrawal kadib paid game</h3>
<div class="formula">Request $10.00 → Fee $0.00 → User wallet −$10.00 → Net cash paid $10.00</div>
<p>Agent withdrawal-ka wuxuu player-ka ka jaraa full request amount; agent float-ku wuxuu ku kordhaa net amount-ka uu dhab ahaan bixiyey, fee-guna app revenue ayuu noqdaa.</p>

<h2>2.4 Pending iyo rejected requests</h2>
<p>Manual request marka la sameeyo lacagta wali lama dhaqaajiyo. Approved kaliya ayaa wallet/float beddela. Rejected request balance ma beddelo. Pending withdrawal-ku wuxuu yareeyaa “withdrawable balance” si duplicate withdrawal looga hortago.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>3. Paid Games iyo Rake</h1>
<h2>3.1 Stakes-ka la heli karo</h2>
<p>Preset stakes: <span class="num">$0.30, $0.50, $0.75, $1, $2, $5, $10, $25, $50, $100</span>. Custom stake: minimum <b>$0.01</b>, maximum <b>$100</b>, ugu badnaan laba decimal.</p>
<div class="formula">Gross Pot = Stake × Real Players<br>Standard Rake = Gross Pot × 10%<br>Winner Payout = Gross Pot − Rake</div>

<h2>3.2 Laba qof Solo — user caadi ah</h2>
<table>
