<tr><td>$100.00</td><td>$200.00</td><td>$20.00</td><td>$180.00</td><td>$80.00</td><td>$100.00</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3.3 Saddex iyo afar qof Solo</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Qaab</th><th>Stake</th><th>Pot</th><th>App</th><th>Hal winner payout</th><th>Winner profit</th></tr>
<tr><td>3-player Solo</td><td>$0.30 qofkiiba</td><td>$0.90</td><td>$0.09</td><td>$0.81</td><td>$0.51</td></tr>
<tr><td>4-player Solo</td><td>$0.30 qofkiiba</td><td>$1.20</td><td>$0.12</td><td>$1.08</td><td>$0.78</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3.4 Partnership 2v2</h2>
<p>Afarta qof stake isku mid ah ayay bixiyaan. Pot-ka net-ka ah waxaa si siman loogu qaybiyaa labada winner. Haddii cent aan si siman u qaybsamin, winner-ka ugu dambeeya ayaa helaya remainder-ka si total-ku u saxnaado.</p>
<div class="formula">$0.30 × 4 = $1.20 pot<br>App = $0.12<br>Team payout = $1.08<br>Winner kasta = $0.54 (net profit $0.24)<br>Loser kasta = −$0.30</div>

<div class="callout warning"><b>Rounding:</b> lacagta waxaa lagu qorayaa laba decimal. Custom stake $0.01, 2-player pot $0.02 wuxuu leeyahay theoretical rake $0.002 oo u wareega $0.00; payout-ku wuxuu noqon karaa $0.02. Sidaas darteed app-ku ciyaartaas rake dhab ah kama helo.</div>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>4. VIP Economy</h1>
<h2>4.1 Qorshayaasha default-ka</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Plan</th><th>Qiime</th><th>Muddo</th><th>Rake discount</th><th>Effective rake</th></tr>
<tr><td>Silver</td><td>$4</td><td>1 bil</td><td>1 percentage point</td><td>9%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gold</td><td>$10</td><td>1 bil</td><td>2 points</td><td>8%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Platinum</td><td>$25</td><td>3 bilood</td><td>4 points</td><td>6%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Diamond</td><td>$45</td><td>6 bilood</td><td>5 points</td><td>5%</td></tr>
</table>
<ul>
<li>VIP price isla markiiba wallet-ka ayaa laga jaraa, dhammaantiisna app revenue ayuu noqdaa.</li>
<li>Renewal isla tier ah wuxuu muddada cusub ka sii raaciyaa expiry-ga hadda jira.</li>
<li>Tier kale ama expired plan wuxuu ka bilaabmaa waqtiga iibka.</li>
<li>Admin-ku qiimaha, muddada, discount-ka iyo features-ka wuu beddeli karaa; discount kama badnaan karo base rake 10%.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4.2 $0.30 Solo payout marka winner VIP yahay</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Winner</th><th>Rate</th><th>App (rounded)</th><th>Payout</th><th>Net profit</th></tr>
<tr><td>Normal</td><td>10%</td><td>$0.06</td><td>$0.54</td><td>$0.24</td></tr>
<tr><td>Silver</td><td>9%</td><td>qiyaastii $0.05</td><td>$0.55</td><td>$0.25</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gold</td><td>8%</td><td>qiyaastii $0.05</td><td>$0.55</td><td>$0.25</td></tr>
<tr><td>Platinum</td><td>6%</td><td>$0.04</td><td>$0.56</td><td>$0.26</td></tr>
<tr><td>Diamond</td><td>5%</td><td>$0.03</td><td>$0.57</td><td>$0.27</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Team game-ka effective rake waxaa laga qaataa celceliska discounts-ka winners-ka dhabta ah. Losers-ka VIP status-kooda rate-ka ma beddelo.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>5. Bot Economy</h1>
<p>Bot game-ku gebi ahaanba wuu ka duwan yahay paid human match:</p>
<ul>
<li>Stake-ka la doortay <b>lama lock-gareeyo</b>.</li>
<li>Haddii human-ku badiyo: wallet + <b>$0.01</b>.</li>
<li>Haddii bot-ku badiyo: human wallet − <b>$0.02</b>, laakiin lagama jari karo wax ka badan balance-ka jira.</li>
<li>Bot charge-ka app revenue category-ga <b>bot_result</b> ayuu galaa.</li>
<li>Team bot game: human winner kasta +$0.01; human loser kasta ilaa −$0.02.</li>
</ul>
<div class="callout"><b>Tusaale:</b> user balance $1.00, stake selector $50 ayuu saaran yahay, bot ayuu la ciyaaray. User hadduu badiyo wuxuu noqdaa $1.01; bot hadduu badiyo wuxuu noqdaa $0.98. $50 lama lock-gareeyo.</div>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>6. Exit, Forfeit, Inactivity, Cancellation iyo Refund</h1>
<table>
<tr><th>Xaalad</th><th>Player money</th><th>Winner/App</th></tr>
<tr><td>Ka bax waiting room kahor start</td><td>Stake wali lama lock-gareyn; wax ganaax ah ma jiro.</td><td>Qolku wuu sii jiraa ama wuu xirmaa.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pending join request cancel</td><td>Wax lacag ah lama jarin.</td><td>Wax dakhli ah ma jiro.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2-player paid game: qof baxa</td><td>Leaver stake wuu luminayaa, loss count +1.</td><td>Opponent wuxuu helaa pot − effective rake; app forfeit rake.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2-player inactivity</td><td>Inactive player stake wuu luminayaa, loss +1.</td><td>Active opponent payout; app forfeit rake.</td></tr>
<tr><td>3/4 Solo: hal qof baxa</td><td>Stake lama celiyo; player left/loss ayaa noqda.</td><td>Ciyaartu way sii socotaa; eventual winner pot oo dhan less rake.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2v2: hal qof baxa/inactive</td><td>Kooxdiisa oo dhan way guuldarraysataa; forfeiter iyo partner loss records.</td><td>Labada opponent waxay qaybsadaan net pot; app forfeit rake.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Admin cancels paid room</td><td>Real player kasta full stake ayaa loo refund-gareeyaa.</td><td>Game rake ma jiro.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tournament match forfeit</td><td>Game-room stake = $0; entry fee tartanka ayaa hore loo bixiyey.</td><td>Opponent round-ka ayuu gudbaa; prize final-ka ayaa bixiya.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="callout danger"><b>Xaalad edge ah:</b> haddii dhammaan active players ay baxaan/inactive noqdaan, code-ku escrow-ga zero ayuu ka dhigayaa iyadoo aan refund ama house-revenue transaction cad la qorin. Tani waa meel audit iyo policy u baahan.</div>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>7. Spectator Betting</h1>
<h2>7.1 Shuruudaha</h2>
<ul>
<li>Keliya spectator aan ciyaarta ku jirin ayaa bet dhigi kara.</li>
<li>Hal bet qofkiiba ciyaar kasta.</li>
<li>Stake minimum <b>$0.10</b>, maximum <b>$10.00</b>.</li>
<li>Doorasho: W (target/team wins) ama L (target/team loses).</li>
<li>Market-ku wuu xirmaa marka token kasta gaaro position 51 ama ka badan.</li>
<li>Risk limit: selected side pool kama badnaan karo ugu badnaan 5× opposing pool, iyadoo minimum balancing base = $1.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7.2 Dynamic pool iyo odds</h2>
<div class="formula">Total Pool = W stakes + L stakes<br>Distributable = Total Pool × 90%<br>App Betting Margin = Total Pool × 10%<br>Final Odds = Distributable Pool ÷ Winning-side Pool</div>
<h3>Tusaale</h3>
<p>W side = $4, L side = $6, total = $10. Haddii target-ku badiyo:</p>
<ul><li>App = $1.</li><li>W bettors waxay saamigooda ugu qaybsadaan $9.</li><li>Final odds = 9 ÷ 4 = 2.25.</li><li>Qof $1 W dhigtay wuxuu helayaa $2.25; net profit $1.25.</li></ul>

<h2>7.3 Goorta bet la refund-gareeyo</h2>
<p>Full stake refund ayaa dhacaya haddii:</p>
<ul>
<li>Room status cancelled yahay.</li>
<li>Server-ku winner sax ah waayo.</li>
<li>Winning side aanu lahayn wax bets ah.</li>
<li>90% distributable pool uusan ka weynayn winning-side principal pool; taas oo macnaheedu yahay winner faa’iido macquul ah ma helayo.</li>
</ul>
<p>Refund xaaladahan app-ku betting margin ma qaato.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>8. Tournaments</h1>
<h2>8.1 Socodka lacagta</h2>
<div class="formula">Collected Entry Fees − Refunds − Prize Pool = Tournament Margin</div>
<ul>
<li>Register: entry fee wallet-ka laga jaraa oo tournament escrow transaction ah noqda.</li>
<li>Winner-ka final-ka: full configured prizePool ayaa wallet-ka loogu daraa.</li>
<li>App revenue: net collected entries − prize.</li>
<li>Custom tournament lama bilaabi karo haddii prize aanu entries-ku si buuxda u fund-gareyn karin.</li>
</ul>

<h2>8.2 Default tournaments</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Tournament</th><th>Entry × Max</th><th>Max collected</th><th>Prize</th><th>Expected margin</th></tr>
<tr><td>Weekly Champion</td><td>$5 × 16</td><td>$80</td><td>$72</td><td>$8</td></tr>
<tr><td>Weekend High Stakes</td><td>$10 × 8</td><td>$80</td><td>$72</td><td>$8</td></tr>
<tr><td>Daily Quick Sprint</td><td>$2 × 4</td><td>$8</td><td>$7.20</td><td>$0.80</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>8.3 Unregister iyo cancellation</h2>
<ul>
<li>Voluntary unregister inta registration open tahay: <b>90% refund</b>, <b>10% cancellation fee</b> app revenue.</li>
<li>Marka tournament bilaabmo ama dhammaado unregister lama oggola.</li>
<li>Haddii aan la fund-gareyn waqtiga start-ka: hal mar 12 saac ayaa dib loo dhigaa; markii labaad waa cancelled oo full entry refunds la bixiyaa.</li>
<li>Check-in window: 5 daqiiqo.</li>
<li>Haddii zero players check-in sameeyaan: tournament cancelled, dhammaan registered players full refund.</li>
<li>Haddii hal player check-in sameeyo: walkover winner ayaa full prize hela.</li>
<li>Haddii laba ama ka badan check-in sameeyaan: kaliya kuwa checked-in ayaa bracket-ka gala.</li>
</ul>
<div class="callout warning"><b>Policy hadda jira:</b> players-ka registration bixiyey laakiin check-in seegay si cad refund looma siinayo. Entry-gooda wuxuu ku sii jiraa net collected calculation. Tani waa no-show penalty aan UI/terms-ka si cad loogu magacaabin.</div>
<h2>8.4 Admin tournament cancellation/removal</h2>
<p>Admin cancel endpoint-ku registered player kasta entry fee-ga buuxa ayuu ugu celiyaa. Admin player-ka tartanka ka saaro sidoo kale entry fee buuxa ayuu refund-gareeyaa. Voluntary unregister-ga user-ka keliya ayaa leh 10% fee.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>9. Agent Economy</h1>
<h2>9.1 Agent linkage</h2>
<p>Promo code ayaa player-ka ku xira agent. Marka la xiro, deposit/withdraw request agent kale looma wareejin karo. Agent-ku wuxuu arkaa linked players iyo requests-kiisa oo keliya.</p>

<h2>9.2 Float purchase iyo commission</h2>
<p>Agent commission-ku ma aha fee laga jaro player transaction kasta. Waa <b>discount uu agent-ku ka helo marka admin-ku float u kordhiyo</b>.</p>
<div class="formula">Agent Float Issued = Requested Float<br>Agent Commission Discount = Float × Commission Rate<br>Admin Cash Received = Float − Commission Discount</div>
<h3>Tusaale: 5% agent commission</h3>
<div class="formula">Float +$100 → Agent discount $5 → Admin cash $95 → Agent usable float $100</div>

<h2>9.3 Player deposit via agent</h2>
<div class="formula">Player wallet +$20 → Agent float −$20</div>
<p>Agent float-ku waa inuu ku filnaadaa. Deposit-ka qudhiisu app revenue ma aha; waa liability/float transfer.</p>

<h2>9.4 Player withdrawal via agent</h2>
<div class="formula">Player wallet −Request Amount → Agent pays Net Amount → Agent float +Net Amount → Fee (haddii jiro) → App</div>
<p>Paid-game user badanaa fee 0% ayuu leeyahay. No-play user fee 10% minimum $0.10.</p>

<h2>9.5 Labada business model</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Model</th><th>Dakhliga/kharashka</th><th>Control</th></tr>
<tr><td>Independent</td><td>Float purchase commission/discount.</td><td>Commission rate admin dejiyo.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Monthly</td><td>Monthly salary; targets iyo daily transaction limit.</td><td>Admin dejiyo salary, monthly target, daily limit iyo status.</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Monthly agent daily limit-ku wuxuu isku daraa PlayerDeposit iyo PlayerWithdrawal amounts-ka maalintaas.</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>10. Admin iyo Cashier</h1>
<h2>10.1 Admin mas’uuliyadaha lacagta</h2>
<ul>
<li>Approve/reject user deposits iyo withdrawals aan agent ku xirnayn.</li>
<li>Approve/reject agent float requests.</li>
<li>Deji agent commission, business model, salary, target iyo limit.</li>
<li>Deji payment providers, VIP plans iyo tournaments.</li>
<li>Cancel room oo full stakes refund samee.</li>
<li>La soco house revenue, net earnings, deposits, withdrawals iyo liabilities.</li>
</ul>

<h2>10.2 Cashier assignment iyo payroll</h2>
<ul>
<li>Cashier waxaa lagu xiraa magaalo/location.</li>
<li>Online window: 75 ilbiriqsi; request assignment lease: 5 daqiiqo.</li>
<li>Cashier monthly salary, monthly target iyo target bonus admin ayaa dejinaya.</li>
<li>Current earnings = salary + bonus haddii target la gaaray.</li>
<li>Cashier payroll paid waxaa admin stats-ku ka jaraa net platform earnings.</li>
</ul>

<h2>10.3 Admin dashboard formulas</h2>
<div class="formula">Recorded House Revenue = Sum of 9 revenue categories<br>Net Platform Earnings = House Revenue − Agent Commission Discounts − Welcome Bonus Cost − Cashier Payroll Paid</div>
<div class="callout warning"><b>Fiiro:</b> monthly agent salary liability dashboard-ka waa la muujiyaa, laakiin formula netPlatformEarnings si toos ah ugama jaro ilaa nidaam payment/expense ahaan loo xaqiijiyo. Sidoo kale hosting, Firebase/TURN, payment-provider charges iyo taxes kuma jiraan formula-kan.</div>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>11. Transaction Ledger iyo Kaydinta</h1>
<h2>11.1 Wallet transaction types</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Type</th><th>Ujeeddo</th></tr>
<tr><td>deposit</td><td>Wallet lacag lagu daray: real deposit, agent deposit ama welcome bonus.</td></tr>
<tr><td>withdrawal</td><td>Wallet lacag laga bixiyey.</td></tr>
<tr><td>bet_escrow_locked</td><td>Stake laga jaray oo game/tournament/bet lagu xidhay.</td></tr>
<tr><td>bet_escrow_refund</td><td>Nooc loogu talagalay escrow return; code-ka badankiisu “refund” ayuu adeegsadaa.</td></tr>
<tr><td>win_payout</td><td>Game, bot, tournament ama spectator bet guul.</td></tr>
<tr><td>app_commission</td><td>House revenue ama user debit sida VIP/bot.</td></tr>
<tr><td>refund</td><td>Stake/entry/bet dib loogu celiyey.</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Transaction kasta wuxuu leeyahay ID, userId, amount, timestamp, description, optional match/reference ID, status iyo revenue category. Duplicate payout waxaa looga hortagaa iyadoo user + matchId + win_payout la hubiyo.</p>

<h2>11.2 Meelaha xogtu ku kaydsan tahay</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Xog</th><th>Kaydka primary</th><th>Waxa lagu hayo</th></tr>
<tr><td>User wallet/profile</td><td>MySQL app_users; Firestore fallback/sync</td><td>Balance, VIP, linked agent, stats</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wallet ledger</td><td>wallet_transactions / persisted store</td><td>Deposit, withdrawal, stakes, payouts, revenue</td></tr>
<tr><td>Manual requests</td><td>manual_transaction_requests</td><td>Pending/approved/rejected iyo resolver</td></tr>
<tr><td>Agent</td><td>agents, agent_transactions, agent_requests</td><td>Float, commission, requests iyo history</td></tr>
<tr><td>Rooms</td><td>game_rooms</td><td>Escrow, winner payout, rake iyo game state</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tournaments/bets</td><td>Persistent store/profile transactions</td><td>Entries, brackets, spectator pools iyo settlement</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>12. Dhammaan Ilaha Dakhliga App-ka</h1>
<table>
<tr><th>Revenue category</th><th>Goorta la helo</th><th>Rate/Formula</th></tr>
<tr><td>game_rake</td><td>Paid Solo normal completion</td><td>Base 10% less winner VIP discount</td></tr>
<tr><td>team_game_rake</td><td>Paid 2v2 normal completion</td><td>Base 10% less average winner discounts</td></tr>
<tr><td>forfeit_rake</td><td>Paid game ku dhammaada exit/inactivity</td><td>Isla effective rake</td></tr>
<tr><td>bot_result</td><td>Bot wins ama real stake retained in mixed bot edge</td><td>Ilaa $0.02 human loser kasta</td></tr>
<tr><td>betting_margin</td><td>Matched spectator market settles</td><td>10% total market pool</td></tr>
<tr><td>withdrawal_fee</td><td>User aan paid game dhammayn withdraw sameeyo</td><td>10%, minimum $0.10</td></tr>
<tr><td>vip_subscription</td><td>VIP purchase/renewal</td><td>Full tier price</td></tr>
<tr><td>tournament_margin</td><td>Tournament winner/prize settled</td><td>Net entries − prize</td></tr>
<tr><td>tournament_cancellation_fee</td><td>User voluntarily unregisters</td><td>10% entry fee</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Dakhliga vs cash flow</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Shay</th><th>Dakhli?</th><th>Sabab</th></tr>
<tr><td>Player deposit</td><td>Maya</td><td>App liability ayuu kordhiyaa; player ayaa leh.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Player withdrawal</td><td>Maya</td><td>Liability ayuu yareeyaa; fee-ga keliya ayaa dakhli ah.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Agent float sale</td><td>Cash flow/working capital</td><td>Admin cash iyo agent float; commission discount waa cost.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Escrow lock</td><td>Weli maya</td><td>Natiijo ayaa la sugayaa.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund</td><td>Maya</td><td>Lacagtii owner-ka ayaa loo celiyey.</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>13. Qaybaha Aan Hadda Dakhli Toos ah Qorin</h1>
<ul>
<li><b>Advertisements:</b> app-ku campaigns/AdSense fields wuu taageeraa, laakiin ad impressions/click earnings uma qoro house revenue ledger. Dakhli ads ah waa in provider report ama integration gaar ah laga keenaa.</li>
<li><b>Practice/free games:</b> rake ama stake ma leh.</li>
<li><b>Watching:</b> daawasho caadi ah lacag ma leh; spectator bet kaliya ayaa dhaqaale leh.</li>
<li><b>Voice chat:</b> user fee ma leh; TURN/hosting wuxuu noqon karaa kharash external ah.</li>
<li><b>Profile, leaderboard, private code:</b> fee gooni ah ma leh; private paid match wuxuu isticmaalaa stake/rake-ka caadiga ah.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
<h1>14. Risk Register iyo Talooyinka</h1>
<table>
<tr><th>Priority</th><th>Arrin hadda jirta</th><th>Saameyn</th><th>Talo</th></tr>
<tr><td>High</td><td>UI “Win $0.60” wuxuu qarinayaa 10% rake.</td><td>User confusion/trust.</td><td>Muuji Gross Pot, Fee, Net Payout iyo Net Profit.</td></tr>
<tr><td>High</td><td>All players leave → escrow zero, refund/revenue trail ma cadda.</td><td>Ledger imbalance.</td><td>Policy cad: refund ama abandoned-pot revenue transaction.</td></tr>
<tr><td>High</td><td>Admin room cancel wuxuu delete-gareeyaa room iyadoo spectator open bets laga yaabo inaan la settle/refund.</td><td>Locked bettor funds.</td><td>Room cancelled status → settleSpectatorBets → kadib delete/archive.</td></tr>
<tr><td>High</td><td>Tournament no-show fee/refund si cad looma magacaabin.</td><td>Complaint iyo terms risk.</td><td>Ku qor no-show forfeiture ama samee refund/fee transaction cad.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Medium</td><td>$0.01 stake rake wuxuu u round-gareeyaa $0.00.</td><td>Zero revenue micro games.</td><td>Minimum paid stake $0.05/$0.10 ama minimum rake $0.01.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Medium</td><td>Direct simulated wallet endpoints waxay mudan yihiin production auth review.</td><td>Financial security risk.</td><td>Disable production ama Firebase/admin auth ku xiro.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Medium</td><td>Net earnings kuma jiraan hosting, provider fees, taxes, TURN iyo unpaid salary liabilities.</td><td>Profit overstated.</td><td>Expense ledger iyo true net P&amp;L ku dar.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Medium</td><td>Ads income ledger ma jiro.</td><td>Revenue reporting incomplete.</td><td>Provider reconciliation/import.</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Recommended player-facing settlement receipt</h2>
<div class="callout good"><b>Guul — $0.30 Solo</b><br>Stake: $0.30 · Total Pot: $0.60 · App Fee: $0.06 · Payout: $0.54 · Your Profit: $0.24</div>
<div class="callout"><b>Guuldarro — $0.30 Solo</b><br>Stake Paid: $0.30 · Result: Lost · Additional Charge: $0.00 · Final Match Change: −$0.30</div>

<h2>Gunaanad</h2>
<p>LudoSom wuxuu leeyahay revenue model isku dhafan: 10% game rake, 10% spectator margin, VIP subscriptions, bot-result charges, tournament margins/cancellation fees iyo conditional withdrawal fee. Agent-ku wuxuu maamulaa float, commission-kiisuna wuxuu ka yimaadaa float purchase discount; admin/cashier-na waxay maamulaan approvals, settings, payroll iyo audit. Nidaamka aasaasiga ahi server-authoritative iyo ledger-based ayuu yahay, balse risk register-ka kore waa in loo qaataa shaqada xigta si financial reporting, refunds iyo user transparency loo adkeeyo.</p>
<div class="footer-note">Dukumentigan waa sharaxaad code-audit ah, ma aha talo sharci ama xisaabeed. Kahor lacag dhab ah oo ballaaran, terms, licensing, tax, responsible-gaming iyo independent financial/security audit waa in la waafajiyaa dalka/markets-ka app-ku ka shaqeeyo.</div>
</section>
